"Dynamic financial reports: the report on screen with its filters at the top,"
" accounts and partners that unfold into their journal items, drill-down, "
"saved views, and export to PDF, Excel and CSV as shown."
msgstr "Dynamiczne raporty finansowe: raport na ekranie z filtrami u góry, konta i kontrahenci rozwijani do pozycji dziennika, drążenie danych, zapisane widoki oraz eksport do PDF, Excel i CSV w postaci takiej jak na ekranie."

